Package: phostor
Title: An App That Adds Stories to Photos!
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("George", "Ostrouchov", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "go@tennessee.edu")
Description: Records spoken commentary about a collection of photos. A Shiny
    app shows the folder tree of a read-only photo directory, displays any
    photo on a click, and records the conversation about it as audio. Each
    visit to a photo writes its own sidecar file holding the audio, the names
    given, and a place, event and date, so a later visit adds to a photo's
    history rather than replacing it. The order photos were viewed in is
    logged as it happens, and a Play button replays a session: the same
    photos, in the same order, with the same audio. The photo directory is
    never written to.
